<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - SeaChange started a buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - SeaChange started a buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons Inc said it started coverage of SeaChange International Inc with a buy rating on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-3/8 to 26-1/4 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- The company went public in early November at $15 a share.</p>
</text>
